--
Fixed 2026-07-21: the synthetic @most_derived flag is a byte-wide
c_bool instead of a 1-bit boolean, so member byte-offsets in
virtual-base classes are computable (member_offset refuses unpadded
bit-field runs) and the pointer checks pass.
